    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Retry + Circuit Breaker Caution",
      "items": [
        "3 retries on POST + consecutiveErrors 5 allows up to 15 duplicates before it activates",
        "Non-idempotent requests: attempts: 0 or retryOn: connect-failure",
        "Implement an Idempotency Key for critical operations like payment and inventory"
